## Local data — the SQLite store and the fetched-page cache are runtime state,
## regenerated by ingestion and never committed. `dotnet run` uses the project
## directory as its working directory, so they land under src/EventFinder.Api/.
## The tracked data/ at the repo root holds the committed gazetteer CSVs.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
data/*.zip
src/EventFinder.Api/data/
src/EventFinder.Api/wwwroot/

